/// [Sprint 57 B2] What the minute becomes on the match feed, decided on the server (App\Simulator\MomentStory, told from the minute as the screen asking may see it): the scene and who is in it, the cards, the commentator's lines and the bubble. Texts are keys of the game's dictionary or parts (StoryText) the screen writes in its language with its names switch; the commentator's lines are places in voice.json (its words never travel).
class MomentStory {
  const MomentStory({
