      side: r.string('side'),
      sub: r.any('sub'),
      who: r.any('who'),
    );
  }

  final Object? bubble;
  final Object? bubbleEn;

  /// What the scene draws: shirt numbers, lane, quality, drama, the scene's own seed v, and so on. tactic and big are StoryText, stats [[StoryText, home, away]], score [home, away]
